{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["渐近线", "有理函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "当 $x\\to 1$ 时，分母趋于 $0$ 而分子不为 $0$，故有一条竖直渐近线 $x=1$；当 $x\\to\\infty$ 时，\n$$\n\\frac{x^2+x}{x^2-1}\\to 1,\n$$\n故有一条水平渐近线 $y=1$。又因 $x=-1$ 时分子分母同为 $0$，化简后是可去间断点，不再产生渐近线，所以共有两条。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "在 $x=0$ 处，只有第一因子 $e^x-1$ 为 $0$，其导数为 $1$；其余因子在 $x=0$ 的值分别为\n$$\ne^{2\\cdot 0}-2=-1,\\ \\ldots,\\ e^{n\\cdot 0}-n=1-n.\n$$\n因而\n$$\nf'(0)=1\\cdot(-1)\\cdot(-2)\\cdots (1-n)=(-1)^{n-1}(n-1)! \\cdot n = (-1)^{n-1}n!.\n$$", "methods": ["乘积求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["数列", "级数必要条件"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "由 $a_n>0$ 可知 $\\{S_n\\}$ 单调递增。若 $\\{S_n\\}$ 有界，则级数 $\\sum a_n$ 收敛，从而必有 $a_n\\to 0$，所以它是充分条件。\n但反过来 $a_n\\to 0$ 不保证 $\\sum a_n$ 收敛，例如 $a_n=\\frac1n$，故不是必要条件。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "参数单调性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "把\n$$\nI(k)=\\int_0^k e^{x^2}\\sin x\\,dx\n$$\n看作关于上限 $k$ 的函数，则\n$$\nI'(k)=e^{k^2}\\sin k.\n$$\n因为 $1,2,3\\in(0,\\pi)$，且在 $(0,\\pi)$ 上有 $\\sin k>0$，所以 $I(k)$ 在该区间单调递增，从而\n$$\nI_1<I_2<I_3.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["多元函数", "单调性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "条件说明 $f$ 关于 $x$ 单调递增，关于 $y$ 单调递减。若 $x_1<x_2$ 且 $y_1>y_2$，则由 $x$ 增大使函数值增大，由 $y$ 减小也使函数值增大，因此\n$$\nf(x_1,y_1)<f(x_2,y_2).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二重积分", "区域对称性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "由于区域关于 $y$ 轴对称，而被积函数中的 $xy^5$ 关于 $x$ 是奇函数，所以\n$$\n\\iint_D xy^5\\,dxdy=0.\n$$\n因而原积分化为\n$$\n-\\iint_D 1\\,dxdy=-|D|.\n$$\n区域面积\n$$\n|D|=\\int_{-\\pi/2}^{\\pi/2}(1-\\sin x)\\,dx=\\pi,\n$$\n故原积分为 $-\\pi$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["向量组线性相关", "线性组合"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "有\n$$\n\\alpha_3+\\alpha_4=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\c_3+c_4\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n它与 $\\alpha_1=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\c_1\\end{pmatrix}$ 共线，所以 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_3,\\alpha_4$ 必线性相关。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["相似矩阵", "基变换"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "由于\n$$\nQ=P\\begin{pmatrix}\n1&0&0\\\\\n1&1&0\\\\\n0&0&1\n\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n而对角矩阵前两个特征值同为 $1$，在对应二维特征子空间内改变基并不会改变其对角形，因此\n$$\nQ^{-1}AQ=\\operatorname{diag}(1,1,2).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二阶导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$1$", "explanation": "由 $x=0$ 可得 $1-y=e^y-1$，解得 $y(0)=0$。对方程两边求导：\n$$\n2x-y'=e^y y'.\n$$\n于是\n$$\ny'=\\frac{2x}{1+e^y},\n$$\n从而 $y'(0)=0$。再对上式求导并代入 $(0,0)$，得到\n$$\n2-y''=e^0(y')^2+e^0 y''=y'',\n$$\n故 $y''(0)=1$。", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "黎曼和"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}$", "explanation": "原式可写为\n$$\n\\sum_{i=1}^n \\frac{1}{n}\\cdot \\frac{1}{1+\\left(\\frac{i}{n}\\right)^2},\n$$\n这是函数 $\\frac{1}{1+x^2}$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上的黎曼和，因此极限为\n$$\n\\int_0^1 \\frac{dx}{1+x^2}=\\arctan 1-\\arctan 0=\\frac{\\pi}{4}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["复合函数", "偏导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$0$", "explanation": "记\n$$\nu=\\ln x+\\frac1y,\\qquad z=f(u).\n$$\n则\n$$\nz_x=f'(u)\\cdot \\frac1x,\\qquad z_y=f'(u)\\cdot\\left(-\\frac1{y^2}\\right).\n$$\n所以\n$$\nxz_x+y^2z_y=f'(u)-f'(u)=0.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分方程", "初值问题"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y=\\sqrt{x}$", "explanation": "将 $x$ 视为 $y$ 的函数，有\n$$\ny\\frac{dx}{dy}+x-3y^2=0,\n$$\n即\n$$\n\\frac{dx}{dy}+\\frac{1}{y}x=3y.\n$$\n这是关于 $x(y)$ 的一阶线性方程。乘积分因子 $y$ 得\n$$\n\\frac{d(xy)}{dy}=3y^2,\n$$\n故\n$$\nxy=y^3+C.\n$$\n代入 $(x,y)=(1,1)$ 得 $C=0$，从而 $x=y^2$。由初值 $y(1)=1>0$，知取正支：\n$$\ny=\\sqrt{x}.\n$$", "methods": ["积分因子"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["曲率", "导数应用"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$(-1,0)$", "explanation": "对曲线 $y=x^2+x$ 有\n$$\ny'=2x+1,\\qquad y''=2.\n$$\n曲率\n$$\nK=\\frac{|y''|}{\\left(1+(y')^2\\right)^{3/2}}\n=\\frac{2}{\\left(1+(2x+1)^2\\right)^{3/2}}.\n$$\n令其等于 $\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}$，化简得\n$$\n(2x+1)^2=1.\n$$\n解得 $x=0$ 或 $x=-1$。由条件 $x<0$，取 $x=-1$，此时 $y=0$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["伴随矩阵", "行列式性质"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$-27$", "explanation": "交换两行使行列式变号，所以\n$$\n|B|=-|A|=-3.\n$$\n又因为 $A$ 为 $3$ 阶矩阵，\n$$\n|A^*|=|A|^{3-1}=|A|^2=9.\n$$\n故\n$$\n|BA^*|=|B|\\cdot |A^*|=(-3)\\cdot 9=-27.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "等价无穷小"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$a=1,\\ k=2$", "explanation": "先算极限：\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{x(1+x)-\\sin x}{x\\sin x}.\n$$\n由 $\\sin x=x-\\frac{x^3}{6}+o(x^3)$，得\n$$\nx(1+x)-\\sin x=x^2+o(x^2),\n$$\n且 $x\\sin x=x^2+o(x^2)$，所以\n$$\na=\\lim_{x\\to 0}f(x)=1.\n$$\n\n再看\n$$\nf(x)-1=\\frac{x-\\sin x}{\\sin x}.\n$$\n由于\n$$\nx-\\sin x\\sim \\frac{x^3}{6},\\qquad \\sin x\\sim x,\n$$\n故\n$$\nf(x)-1\\sim \\frac{x^2}{6}.\n$$\n因而它与 $x^k$ 同阶时应有 $k=2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["多元函数极值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "极大值为 $\\dfrac1{\\sqrt e}$（在 $(1,0)$ 处），极小值为 $-\\dfrac1{\\sqrt e}$（在 $(-1,0)$ 处）", "explanation": "有\n$$\nf_x=e^{-\\frac{x^2+y^2}{2}}(1-x^2),\\qquad\nf_y=-xye^{-\\frac{x^2+y^2}{2}}.\n$$\n令偏导同时为零，得驻点为 $(1,0)$ 与 $(-1,0)$。\n\n固定 $x$ 时，$e^{-(x^2+y^2)/2}$ 在 $y=0$ 处最大，因此极值只能落在 $y=0$ 上。于是问题化为研究\n$$\ng(x)=xe^{-x^2/2}.\n$$\n有\n$$\ng'(x)=e^{-x^2/2}(1-x^2),\n$$\n故在 $x=1$ 取极大值，在 $x=-1$ 取极小值。相应函数值为\n$$\ng(1)=e^{-1/2}=\\frac1{\\sqrt e},\\qquad g(-1)=-e^{-1/2}=-\\frac1{\\sqrt e}.\n$$", "methods": ["驻点判别"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 12, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["曲线切线", "面积", "旋转体体积"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "面积为 $2$，体积为 $\\dfrac{8\\pi}{3}$", "explanation": "设切点为 $A(x_0,\\ln x_0)$。曲线 $y=\\ln x$ 在 $A$ 点的切线为\n$$\ny-\\ln x_0=\\frac1{x_0}(x-x_0).\n$$\n代入点 $(0,1)$，得\n$$\n1-\\ln x_0=-1,\\qquad \\ln x_0=2,\n$$\n所以 $x_0=e^2$，即 $A=(e^2,2)$。又曲线 $L$ 与 $x$ 轴交于\n$$\nB=(1,0).\n$$\n因而弦 $AB$ 的方程为\n$$\ny=\\frac{2}{e^2-1}(x-1),\n$$\n即\n$$\nx=1+\\frac{e^2-1}{2}y.\n$$\n\n用 $y$ 作积分变量，曲线写成 $x=e^y$，积分区间为 $0\\le y\\le 2$。面积为\n$$\nS=\\int_0^2 \\left(1+\\frac{e^2-1}{2}y-e^y\\right)\\,dy=2.\n$$\n\n绕 $x$ 轴旋转的体积为\n$$\nV=\\pi\\int_0^2 y^2\\left(1+\\frac{e^2-1}{2}y-e^y\\right)\\,dy\n=\\frac{8\\pi}{3}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极坐标", "二重积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{15}{16}$", "explanation": "改用极坐标：\n$$\nx=r\\cos\\theta,\\qquad y=r\\sin\\theta,\\qquad d\\sigma=r\\,dr\\,d\\theta.\n$$\n于是\n$$\n\\iint_D xy\\,d\\sigma\n=\\int_0^\\pi\\int_0^{1+\\cos\\theta} r^3\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\,dr\\,d\\theta\n=\\frac14\\int_0^\\pi (1+\\cos\\theta)^4\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta.\n$$\n令 $u=1+\\cos\\theta$ 或直接展开积分，可得结果\n$$\n\\iint_D xy\\,d\\sigma=\\frac{15}{16}.\n$$", "methods": ["极坐标变换"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["常系数线性微分方程", "拐点"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$f(x)=e^x$；拐点为 $(0,0)$", "explanation": "由\n$$\nf''+f'-2f=0\n$$\n的特征方程\n$$\nr^2+r-2=0\n$$\n得通解\n$$\nf(x)=C_1e^x+C_2e^{-2x}.\n$$\n代入第二个方程\n$$\nf''+f=2e^x\n$$\n可解得 $C_1=1,\\ C_2=0$，故\n$$\nf(x)=e^x.\n$$\n\n于是\n$$\ny=e^{x^2}\\int_0^x e^{-t^2}\\,dt.\n$$\n计算导数可得 $y''(0)=0$，并可验证当 $x<0$ 时 $y''<0$、当 $x>0$ 时 $y''>0$，故凹凸性在 $x=0$ 两侧改变，所以唯一拐点为\n$$\n(0,0).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "proof", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不等式证明", "单调性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "见解析", "explanation": "令\n$$\nF(x)=x\\ln\\frac{1+x}{1-x}+\\cos x-1-\\frac{x^2}{2}.\n$$\n有 $F(0)=0$。计算导数：\n$$\nF'(x)=\\ln\\frac{1+x}{1-x}-\\sin x+\\frac{2x}{1-x^2}-x.\n$$\n在 $(-1,1)$ 上可利用\n$$\n\\ln\\frac{1+x}{1-x}\\ge 2x,\\qquad \\sin x\\le x\n$$\n以及 $\\frac{2x}{1-x^2}-x\\ge 0$（按 $x>0$、$x<0$ 分别讨论）推出 $F'(x)\\ge 0$。因此 $F$ 在 $(-1,1)$ 上以 $0$ 为最小值点，从而\n$$\nF(x)\\ge F(0)=0,\n$$\n即\n$$\nx\\ln\\frac{1+x}{1-x}+\\cos x\\ge 1+\\frac{x^2}{2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "proof", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["方程根", "数列极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "在 $\\left(\\dfrac12,1\\right)$ 内有唯一实根；且 $\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}x_n=\\frac12$", "explanation": "令\n$$\nf_n(x)=x+x^2+\\cdots+x^n-1.\n$$\n在 $\\left(\\frac12,1\\right)$ 上，$f_n'(x)=1+2x+\\cdots+nx^{n-1}>0$，故 $f_n$ 严格递增。\n又\n$$\nf_n\\!\\left(\\frac12\\right)=\\frac12+\\frac14+\\cdots+\\frac1{2^n}-1<0,\\qquad\nf_n(1)=n-1>0,\n$$\n由介值定理知在 $\\left(\\frac12,1\\right)$ 内恰有一个实根。\n\n由方程\n$$\nx_n+x_n^2+\\cdots+x_n^n=1\n$$\n可知 $x_n>\\frac12$。又比较 $f_{n+1}(x_n)=x_n^{n+1}>0$，而 $f_{n+1}$ 递增，得 $x_{n+1}<x_n$，所以 $\\{x_n\\}$ 单调递减且下有界，从而收敛。\n设极限为 $a$。由\n$$\nx_n(1-x_n^n)=1-x_n\n$$\n或直接对原式放缩并令 $n\\to\\infty$，可得极限满足\n$$\n\\frac{a}{1-a}=1,\n$$\n故\n$$\na=\\frac12.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q022", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 22, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["线性方程组", "无穷多解"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q022.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "$\\lvert A\\rvert=1-a^4$；当 $a=-1$ 时有无穷多解，通解为 $\\begin{pmatrix}t\\\\ t-1\\\\ t\\\\ t\\end{pmatrix}$", "explanation": "先计算行列式，可得\n$$\n\\lvert A\\rvert=1-a^4.\n$$\n因而方程组要有无穷多解，必须先有 $\\lvert A\\rvert=0$，即 $a=\\pm 1$。\n\n分别代入增广矩阵检验相容性：当 $a=1$ 时方程组不相容；当 $a=-1$ 时，\n$$\n\\begin{cases}\nx_1-x_2=1,\\\\\nx_2-x_3=-1,\\\\\nx_3-x_4=0,\\\\\n-x_1+x_4=0.\n\\end{cases}\n$$\n由后两式得 $x_4=x_1,\\ x_3=x_1$，再由第二式得 $x_2=x_1-1$。令 $x_1=t$，则通解为\n$$\nx=\\begin{pmatrix}t\\\\ t-1\\\\ t\\\\ t\\end{pmatrix}\n=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\ -1\\\\ 0\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix}\n+t\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 1\\\\ 1\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012_q023", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2012", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2012, "question_number": 23, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["二次型", "秩", "正交变换"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2012_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2012_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q023.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "$a=-1$；可化为标准形 $2y_1^2+6y_2^2$（另一个特征值为 $0$）", "explanation": "由\n$$\n\\operatorname{rank}(A^{\\mathsf T}A)=\\operatorname{rank}(A)=2\n$$\n可知矩阵 $A$ 的秩为 $2$。对 $A$ 做行列式或子式计算，可得唯一满足条件的参数为\n$$\na=-1.\n$$\n\n此时\n$$\nA^{\\mathsf T}A=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n2&0&2\\\\\n0&2&2\\\\\n2&2&4\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n它的特征值为\n$$\n0,\\ 2,\\ 6.\n$$\n取对应的单位正交特征向量为\n$$\n\\alpha_1=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ -1\\\\ 0\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\n\\alpha_2=\\frac1{\\sqrt6}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 1\\\\ 2\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\n\\alpha_3=\\frac1{\\sqrt3}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 1\\\\ -1\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n令\n$$\nQ=(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3),\n$$\n则 $Q$ 为正交矩阵，且\n$$\nQ^{\\mathsf T}(A^{\\mathsf T}A)Q=\\operatorname{diag}(2,6,0).\n$$\n因而在正交变换 $x=Qy$ 下，\n$$\nf=2y_1^2+6y_2^2.\n$$", "methods": []}
